OL,3,GNEWSAHopes A&E extension will process
OL,4,Apatients quicker
OL,5,
OL,6,FA hospital criticised for casualty
OL,7,Fwaiting times said it hoped an
OL,8,Fextension to the A&E department would
OL,9,Fallow it to process patients more
OL,10,Feffectively.
OL,12,FWork will be carried out at Queen
OL,13,FElizabeth Hospital in King's Lynn,
OL,14,FNorfolk, to provide more waiting room
OL,15,Fspace and extra parking for ambulances.
OL,17,FThe hospital said the plans, approved
OL,18,Fby the local council, would "help
OL,19,Falleviate pressure on core A&E
OL,20,Ffacilities".
